  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth led GESI initiatives for COVID recovery strategies and actions in Nepal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project will build the human capital of youth and young women (aged 18 -40) in Karnali and Sudurpaschim province. At the same time will support in strengthening the capacity of service provider and local palika to delivery survivor centric and youth friendly services. As well as bring youth and young model as model of green business model. Total reach of project is 25,000 youths.</narrative>
  </description>
